message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Crack-Fracture-CAE: scale-invariant hybrid physics+neural damage CAE engine (Brazilian disc splitting)"
abstract: >-
  Scale-invariant hybrid (physics + neural) damage CAE engine for quasi-brittle
  fracture. Q4/plane-strain FEM with Mazars damage and fracture-energy
  regularization, matrix-free PCG, Germano self-supervised neural closure,
  reproducibility harness, and DAT-driven general FEA. Apache-2.0.
